  "note": "Every number the portfolio page and résumé state about the decoder. `make claims` checks each against the file that produced it, then scans the decoder text in index.html and the résumé for numbers not listed in published_strings. Paths use '/' because result keys contain dots (\"v2@0.0\").",
  "published_strings": ["115 days", "11-class", "87.3%", "87.9%", "30.8%", "68%", "86%", "45%", "31%", "87%", "23–474 Hz", "1.65 V"],
